<script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={ld} />

<header><div class="w"><a class="logo" href="/">puppet<i>.</i></a><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="/booking">Booking</a><a href="/tasks">Tasks</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/customers">Customers</a><a href="/docs">Docs</a></nav><span class="sp"></span><a class="hide-m" style="color:#C0C0C0;text-decoration:none" href="/login">Sign in</a><a class="btn hide-m" href="/signup">Start free trial</a><button class="burger" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" style="padding:0"><div class="w"><div>
<h1>Run your business. We pull the strings.</h1>
<p>Online booking, project management and more, all on one secure Puppet account. Your brand, your domain, on web, iPhone and Android.</p>
<div class="row"><a class="btn" href="/signup">Start 14-day free trial</a><a class="btn gh" href="/demo">Book a demo</a></div>
<div class="trust"><b>★ 4.8</b> from early customers · No card needed · Cancel anytime</div></div>
