<section id="products"><div class="w"><h2>One account. Every tool your business needs.</h2><p class="lead">Start with one product and add more when you grow. Same sign-in, same billing, same team.</p>
<div class="g"><article class="c"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"/></svg></div><h3>Puppet Booking</h3><p>Online appointment scheduling with staff calendars, deposits, reminders and a booking page on your own domain.</p><a class="more" href="/booking">Explore Booking →</a></article>
<article class="c"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"/><path d="m15 17 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Puppet Tasks</h3><p>Project management with boards, lists, docs and built-in AI. Turn voice notes into tasks in seconds.</p><a class="more" href="/tasks">Explore Tasks →</a></article>
<article class="c"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/></svg></div><h3>More coming</h3><p>CRM, invoicing and forms are on the roadmap. Every new product joins your existing account.</p><a class="more" href="/roadmap">See roadmap →</a></article></div></div></section>

<section style="background:#fff"><div class="w split"><div><h2>Online booking software that looks like your brand</h2><p class="lead">Customers book in three taps. You get fewer no-shows and a calendar that fills itself.</p><ul><li>Booking page on booking.yourbrand.com</li><li>Staff schedules, breaks and holidays</li><li>SMS and email reminders</li><li>Deposits and payments with Stripe</li></ul><a class="btn" href="/booking">See Booking features</a></div><div class="mock" role="img" aria-label="Booking dashboard preview"><div></div><div class="m2"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="w split"><div class="mock" role="img" aria-label="Tasks board preview"><div></div><div class="m2"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div><div><h2>Project management with AI built in</h2><p class="lead">Plan, assign and ship work in one place. Use Puppet AI or bring your own key.</p><ul><li>Boards, lists, calendar and timeline views</li><li>AI summaries, task writing and voice to task</li><li>Guests and client portals</li><li>Time tracking and reports</li></ul><a class="btn" href="/tasks">See Tasks features</a></div></div></section>

<section class="dark"><div class="w"><h2>Built for business, secure by default</h2><p class="lead">Enterprise-grade features on every plan, not just the expensive one.</p>
<div class="g g4"><div class="c"><h3>Your brand</h3><p>Themes, logo, colors and custom domain.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Single sign-on</h3><p>Google, Microsoft, SAML and MFA.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Roles & audit log</h3><p>Fine-grained permissions, full history.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Every device</h3><p>Web, iPad, iPhone and Android apps.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Fast</h3><p>Pages load in under a second.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Accessible</h3><p>WCAG 2.2 AA tested.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Private</h3><p>GDPR ready, data export anytime.</p></div><div class="c"><h3>Reliable</h3><p>99.9% uptime, live status page.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section><div class="w"><h2>Up and running in 3 steps</h2><div class="g steps"><div><div class="n">1</div><h3>Create your account</h3><p>Sign up free in under a minute.</p></div><div><div class="n">2</div><h3>Pick your products</h3><p>Turn on Booking, Tasks or both.</p></div><div><div class="n">3</div><h3>Share your link</h3><p>Send customers your booking page.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section style="background:#fff"><div class="w"><div class="g"><div><div class="stat">40%</div><p>fewer no-shows with reminders</p></div><div><div class="stat">5 min</div><p>average setup time</p></div><div><div class="stat">24/7</div><p>online booking for your customers</p></div></div></div></section>

<section><div class="w"><h2>Loved by small teams</h2><div class="g"><blockquote class="c q">"Our clients book themselves now. Phone calls dropped by half."<cite>Owner, hair salon</cite></blockquote><blockquote class="c q">"Tasks replaced three tools for our agency."<cite>Founder, design studio</cite></blockquote><blockquote class="c q">"Setup took one afternoon."<cite>Manager, physio clinic</cite></blockquote></div></div></section>

<section class="pr" id="pricing" style="background:#fff"><div class="w"><h2>Simple pricing</h2><p class="lead">Every plan includes all products, free trial and support.</p>
<div class="g"><div class="c"><h3>Starter</h3><div class="price">$X<small>/mo</small></div><ul><li>1 product</li><li>Up to 3 users</li><li>Email support</li></ul><a class="btn gh dk" style="color:#2A2A2A;border-color:#2A2A2A" href="/signup">Start trial</a></div>
<div class="c hot"><h3>Business</h3><div class="price">$Y<small>/mo</small></div><ul><li>All products</li><li>Up to 25 users</li><li>Custom domain</li></ul><a class="btn" href="/signup">Start trial</a></div>
<div class="c"><h3>Enterprise</h3><div class="price">Custom</div><ul><li>SSO and SAML</li><li>Unlimited users</li><li>SLA and onboarding</li></ul><a class="btn gh" style="color:#2A2A2A;border-color:#2A2A2A" href="/contact">Talk to sales</a></div></div></div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="w" style="max-width:820px"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<details open><summary>Is there a free trial?</summary><p>Yes. 14 days, all features, no credit card.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I use my own domain?</summary><p>Yes, on Business and Enterprise. Otherwise you get yourname.booking.puppet.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you have mobile apps?</summary><p>Yes, for iPhone, iPad and Android, plus an installable web app.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is my data secure?</summary><p>Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, with MFA, roles and audit logs.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I cancel anytime?</summary><p>Yes, no contracts. Export your data whenever you like.</p></details></div></section>

<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="w"><div class="cta"><h2>Start free today</h2><p>Join businesses running on Puppet. No card needed.</p><a class="btn" href="/signup">Start free trial</a><div class="stores"><span>App Store</span><span>Google Play</span></div></div></div></section>
